WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Mother, what are you doing?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,200
I'm pregnant

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:10,850
Xu Zhi, your grandmother has been extremely guilty recently.

4
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,850
It's hard to avoid speaking a little too seriously

5
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:14,250
Don't take it to heart

6
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,450
I can just accompany my mother here.

7
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:17,850
You guys go out first

8
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,380
My grandson-in-law said something unkind to you.

9
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,740
Grandma might as well ask my uncle

10
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:26,540
This reveals how she was banned

11
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:32,890
I thought that to be ashamed of my hooves was at best to punish my phoenix for being naked.

12
00:00:33,290 --> 00:00:35,690
Who would have thought that the imperial edict would require me to be dismissed from my post and investigate on my behalf?

13
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,090
I was afraid that Shen Yan would do something bad, so I rushed here in a hurry. I didn’t expect that

14
00:00:39,490 --> 00:00:42,260
Song Yu, this bitch

15
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:44,930
How could she know the inside story I announced?
